    "filename": "ping4leon6-commentary-example-2",
    "id": "ping4leon6-commentary-example-2",
    "text": "記者喺節目上評論政治形勢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ping4leon6-commentary-example-3",
    "id": "ping4leon6-commentary-example-3",
    "text": "我覺得佢嘅評論好有見地。"
  },
