    "filename": "ping4leon6-commentary-example-4",
    "id": "ping4leon6-commentary-example-4",
    "text": "評論員經常就社會問題發表意見。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "san1man4-news",
    "id": "san1man4-news",
    "text": "新聞"
  },
  {
    "filename": "san1man4-news-example-1",
    "id": "san1man4-news-example-1",
    "text": "你今晚有冇睇新聞？"
  },
  {
    "filename": "san1man4-news-example-2",
    "id": "san1man4-news-example-2",
    "text": "新聞講緊呢件事, 好多人都關心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "san1man4-news-example-3",
    "id": "san1man4-news-example-3",
    "text": "佢係新聞記者, 經常要出埠採訪。"
  },
