    "filename": "san1man4-news-example-4",
    "id": "san1man4-news-example-4",
    "text": "我最鍾意睇國際新聞，了解世界狀況。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "se5gaau1mui5tai4-social-media",
    "id": "se5gaau1mui5tai4-social-media",
    "text": "社交媒體"
