    "filename": "se5gaau1mui5tai4-social-media-example-2",
    "id": "se5gaau1mui5tai4-social-media-example-2",
    "text": "依家好多企業都會利用社交媒體做宣傳。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "se5gaau1mui5tai4-social-media-example-3",
    "id": "se5gaau1mui5tai4-social-media-example-3",
    "text": "社交媒體可以幫助人哋建立同朋友嘅聯繫。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "se5gaau1mui5tai4-social-media-example-4",
    "id": "se5gaau1mui5tai4-social-media-example-4",
    "text": "佢喺社交媒體度分享自己嘅旅行經歷。"
  },
